# Files exempt from the CI voice gate.
#
# Every path below is part of the April to May 2026 import: canonical specs, write-once
# session handoffs, and review snapshots that predate Editorial Voice v1.2. They carry
# 1,667 hard-rule hits between them, all dashes.
#
# They are exempt rather than fixed for two reasons. guard-docs.mjs blocks agents from
# editing docs/*.md specs at all, so an agent cannot launder them. And handoffs and
# reviews are write-once records; rewriting them changes what the record says happened.
#
# This is a list of paths, not a pattern. A new file anywhere, including a new handoff
# or a new review, is gated normally. Clean a doc's dashes by hand and delete its line.
#
# Nothing outside docs/ appears here. The gate is green on everything this project authored.
